# gitpp-app derivation attestation — TEST public key
#
# THIS IS THE TEST KEY. It is the public half of a throwaway pair made
# for development; the private half never entered this repository. The
# production key replaces it at deploy time: the deploy operator
# generates the production pair, writes the public half here (over
# these lines) and the private half into the Worker secret
# ATTESTATION_KEY, and links this file from the landing page.
#
# Format: the raw 32-byte Ed25519 public key, base64. The key id
# (the first 8 hex chars of this key's SHA-256) is what a Check's
# `## Attestation` section names, so a reader can tell at a glance
# which key signed it.
#
# TEST key id: d4ce0b23
78wimAwT/n/1kBftcwVXPeUrvPX8vP7gT0Za+UkRhyA=
